WEBVTT

00:05:28.156 --> 00:05:33.796
The monster has a middle
with a quiet place.

00:05:34.316 --> 00:05:36.996
She sits on the bare ground

00:05:36.996 --> 00:05:40.236
and looks up at the towering
vortex around her.

00:05:41.076 --> 00:05:43.396
A rain of debris patters down.

00:05:44.516 --> 00:05:46.156
There is a deep rumble,

00:05:46.156 --> 00:05:49.316
and she thinks she hears the monster say,

00:05:49.316 --> 00:05:50.316
“Why?”

00:05:51.596 --> 00:05:53.156
“To learn,” says the girl.

00:05:53.396 --> 00:05:54.676
“I’ve lost everything --

00:05:54.676 --> 00:05:56.676
lost my chance to learn at school.

00:05:57.036 --> 00:05:58.036
Teach me.”

00:05:59.836 --> 00:06:04.636
To the boy outside
with the clock in his arms,